    "detailed_description": "<strong>Interesting puzzle line game</strong><br><strong>There are three ways to play the game:</strong><br>1. Constellation connection.<br>2. In fragment mode, you drag the right fragment to form a complete image.<br>3. Huarong Road mode, you need to complete the complete image bit by bit according to the space position.<br><strong> Game features: </strong><br>When you do the jigsaw, there will be a percentage progress. When the progress reaches a certain level, the corresponding changes will be made to the pictures you spell, and the more difficult Huarong Road mode will unlock the large pictures into the favorites.<br><strong>Favorites:</strong><br>You can see the big picture of Huarong Road mode unlocking, enjoy it.",
